# .gitignore — Dispatch It (mkp-tools/mkp-dispatch)
# v1 2026-10-10  Added during the v14 cleanup: Wrangler's local cache
#                (worker/.wrangler) had been committed by accident. It's
#                machine-specific build state, not source — and could hold
#                local dev data. Remove the already-committed copy once with:
#                  git rm -r --cached --ignore-unmatch mkp-dispatch/worker/.wrangler
worker/.wrangler/
node_modules/
.dev.vars
*.log
